#: src/conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui:144
msgid ""
"By default, GnuPG uses the file ~/.gnupg/policies.txt to check if a "
"certificate policy is allowed. If this option is selected, policies are not "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumijevano, GnuPG koristi datoteku ~/.gnupg/policies.txt za provjeru da "
"li su pravila certifikata dopuštena. Ako je ova opcija odabrana, pravila se "
"ne provjeravaju."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, doNotCheckCertPolicyCB)
#: src/conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui:147
